@meeting train.m3i.tomas
// Pillar 5, M3 the inspection (Day 4, Thursday, before 06:30, Bunk 1): Tomas shows you the three things. The day's
// small new thing. Head writer, seat W. (Calder walks the wing on your first; later the duty officer.)
title: Inspection morning
from: Tomas
gist: Tomas showed you the Thursday inspection: a clean uniform, your berth made, your locker tidy. Before 06:30.
== lines
tomas: Oh no. Thursday. Inspection. I forgot it was Thursday.   [sigh]
tomas > you: Three things. Clean uniform. Bed made. Locker tidy. Before half six.
tomas: Corners. She checks the corners. I think she has a ruler. I've never seen it.
tomas: Tidy means nothing loose. Put things away. All the things.
? choice
* Help me with the corners?   rel:tomas+2 flavour:practical
  tomas: Fold, tuck, fold again. Like a parcel. A very flat parcel.   [gesture]
* What if it's not perfect?   rel:tomas+1 flavour:listen
  tomas: Then she says something. Quietly. That's worse, sort of. But that's all.
* You'll be fine, Tomas.   rel:tomas+1 flavour:cheer
  tomas: Will I? Yes. I will. Thank you. Thank you.   [laugh]
tomas: Quick. She's on the stairs. No, the lift. Same thing. Quick.
